## Instructions for launching the program and verifying (validating) changes.

 1. From the folder .infrastructure execute the command:
```
kubectl apply -f namespace.yml 
```
This will create a namespace for the program ToDo.

 2. To make it easier to work with the context later, set the default context for the newly created namespace by running the following command::
```
kubectl config set-context --current --namespace=todoapp
```

 3. Next, apply all the manifests in the folder using the following command:
```
kubectl apply -f .
```

### To verify that the variables were successfully passed, connect to one of the pods using the command:
```
kubectl exec -it <pod-name> -- sh
```
In interactive mode, enter the command to view these variables:
```
printenv
```
**See the relevant variables: SECRET_KEY and PYTHONUNBUFFERED, respectively.**
